    "title": "Trump drops plan to charge Hormuz transit fee, shifts focus to Gulf investment",
    "description": "WASHINGTON: US President Donald Trump on Tuesday abandoned plans to impose a 20 percent fee on vessels using the Strait of Hormuz, saying he would instead pursue investment agreements with Gulf countries. The reversal came hours before the proposed charge was due to take effect and following criticism from the shipping industry amid continued military escalation from the US",
